WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.780
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.050 --> 00:29.360
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.450 --> 00:32.950
[Episode 18]

4
00:33.790 --> 00:34.670
The secret of immortality has been revealed.

5
00:34.670 --> 00:38.270
The 3,000-year-old immortal body has been completely exposed.

6
00:38.920 --> 00:40.050
The story is blowing up online.

7
00:40.050 --> 00:42.120
It turns out someone who's lived for 3,000 years

8
00:42.120 --> 00:43.320
really does exist.

9
00:46.000 --> 00:47.670
What are they doing?

10
00:49.480 --> 00:50.910
Chasing the hype.

11
00:51.030 --> 00:52.840
They're just chasing the hype.

12
00:55.860 --> 00:57.200
Let's go. Hurry, hurry.

13
00:57.220 --> 00:58.550
Let's go. Hurry, hurry.

14
01:00.630 --> 01:01.990
What should we do now?

15
01:02.010 --> 01:03.870
It seems that time has come again.

16
01:04.150 --> 01:04.640
Time...

17
01:05.069 --> 01:06.040
time for what?

18
01:09.190 --> 01:10.140
Time to move.

19
01:13.560 --> 01:14.310
I'll do it.

20
01:14.810 --> 01:15.730
Done.

21
01:15.280 --> 01:18.530
[Step 1: Find the whistleblower]

22
01:16.680 --> 01:18.150
Step one of crisis management.

23
01:18.150 --> 01:19.230
Find the source of the leak.

24
01:19.230 --> 01:20.310
Buy out the news.

25
01:20.310 --> 01:21.910
And cut off the spread first.

26
01:23.200 --> 01:25.060
Your account is the first source.

27
01:25.230 --> 01:27.490
Tell me where the information came from.

28
01:27.870 --> 01:29.289
You won't be shortchanged.

29
01:29.289 --> 01:31.090
Someone gave me some materials.

30
01:31.310 --> 01:34.110
They said I could make a lot of money if I exposed it.

31
01:34.440 --> 01:35.130
Let me

32
01:35.390 --> 01:36.520
see your sincerity.

33
01:47.330 --> 01:49.850
Everything that person gave me is here.

34
01:51.840 --> 01:52.590
Step two.

35
01:52.680 --> 01:53.840
Fight fire with fire.

36
01:53.840 --> 01:55.710
It's easier to make people feel like they've been played

37
01:54.580 --> 01:57.330
[Step 2: Fight fire with fire]

38
01:55.710 --> 01:57.200
than to make them believe you.

39
01:57.200 --> 01:59.310
Of course, it's our anti-aging cream.

40
01:59.310 --> 02:00.680
Guys, our anti-aging cream

41
02:00.680 --> 02:01.760
absorbs super fast.

42
02:01.760 --> 02:03.480
Keep using it can fade fine lines.

43
02:03.480 --> 02:05.510
It's truly a miracle for keeping you looking young.

44
02:05.510 --> 02:07.070
Click the link in the top left corner.

45
02:07.070 --> 02:09.120
You can also get a 99-yuan coupon.

46
02:10.800 --> 02:11.470
Say it.

47
02:12.240 --> 02:12.800
Price.

48
02:13.010 --> 02:13.560
Price.

49
02:14.360 --> 02:16.250
Not 1999.

50
02:16.280 --> 02:17.160
What? Only...

51
02:17.240 --> 02:19.520
Only 199.

52
02:19.520 --> 02:20.750
-It's so expensive. -It's a good deal.

53
02:20.750 --> 02:21.590
No, no.

54
02:21.590 --> 02:22.390
Hello, hello.

55
02:22.470 --> 02:24.030
The brand just said

56
02:24.030 --> 02:26.680
they can give us another 50% off.

57
02:26.800 --> 02:28.560
Oh my god, look.

58
02:28.710 --> 02:30.360
The secret to eternal life is being livestreamed,

59
02:30.360 --> 02:31.620
and they even have a shopping cart.

60
02:31.620 --> 02:34.150
The comments all say this person is a scammer.

61
02:34.690 --> 02:35.960
Waited two days for nothing.

62
02:35.960 --> 02:37.490
Just another clout chaser.

63
02:37.710 --> 02:38.680
Let's go, everyone.

64
02:38.680 --> 02:40.940
Forget it. It's really boring. Let's go.

65
02:41.150 --> 02:43.710
I thought there was big news. Waited for nothing.

66
02:43.710 --> 02:44.360
Let's go.

67
02:46.079 --> 02:46.710
Step three.

68
02:46.380 --> 02:52.100
[Step 3: Find the mastermind]

69
02:47.190 --> 02:48.790
Find the person behind this.

70
02:49.030 --> 02:50.430
This leak is too precise.

71
02:50.560 --> 02:53.020
Someone must be deliberately targeting us.

72
02:55.520 --> 02:56.430
He actually has evidence

73
02:56.430 --> 02:58.360
that we have lived for 3,000 years.

74
03:01.120 --> 03:02.430
What does he stand to gain

75
03:02.430 --> 03:04.520
by spreading all this evidence?

76
03:07.630 --> 03:08.240
Boss.

77
03:08.590 --> 03:11.120
Are you sure all these things need to be moved?

78
03:11.680 --> 03:12.280
yes.

79
03:14.260 --> 03:14.860
Move them.

80
03:17.190 --> 03:18.660
Princess Ningjia.

81
03:19.620 --> 03:20.870
Song Baiwei.

82
03:25.670 --> 03:26.240
Wait.

83
03:46.560 --> 03:47.680
General Yu.

84
03:48.590 --> 03:50.450
I didn't expect that in this life,

85
03:51.030 --> 03:52.770
the one Princess Ningjia fell in love with

86
03:52.770 --> 03:54.400
would be you.

87
04:09.520 --> 04:11.100
I remembered something very important.

88
04:11.100 --> 04:12.540
I think I need to tell you.

89
04:15.640 --> 04:17.350
Your clothes...

90
04:17.390 --> 04:18.070
A disguise.

91
04:18.269 --> 04:19.200
Couple outfits.

92
04:19.310 --> 04:20.839
Let's get down to business.

93
04:21.269 --> 04:21.750
Okay.

94
04:22.480 --> 04:23.880
I remembered something.

95
04:24.360 --> 04:26.550
The person who killed me in the Republic of China era

96
04:26.550 --> 04:28.480
said something to me before I died.

97
04:28.600 --> 04:29.800
He said, "General Yu,

98
04:30.040 --> 04:30.510
I didn't expect

99
04:30.510 --> 04:32.120
the person Princess Ningjia fell in love with in this life

100
04:32.120 --> 04:33.070
would be you."

101
04:36.630 --> 04:37.950
Who do you think he is?

102
04:39.120 --> 04:41.190
How could he know our identities from 3,000 years ago

103
04:41.190 --> 04:42.690
and live until the Republic of China era?

104
04:42.690 --> 04:43.490
Wait a minute.

105
04:45.720 --> 04:47.190
You mean

106
04:47.630 --> 04:50.560
the person who killed you in the Republic of China era

107
04:50.560 --> 04:52.850
knew our identities in Southern Qin?

108
04:58.390 --> 04:59.270
Could it be

109
05:02.750 --> 05:04.870
that besides you and me in this world,

110
05:05.310 --> 05:07.040
there is a third immortal?

111
05:16.520 --> 05:17.780
Maybe more than three.

112
05:19.830 --> 05:20.620
The person who leaked the news

113
05:20.620 --> 05:22.790
knew we've been in love for 3,000 years.

114
05:22.790 --> 05:24.390
Maybe he is also an immortal.

115
05:28.890 --> 05:30.550
There's no such coincidence.

116
05:30.930 --> 05:32.760
Maybe the person who killed you that night

117
05:32.760 --> 05:34.090
is the same person

118
05:34.659 --> 05:35.890
who leaked the news.

119
05:39.830 --> 05:41.120
If that's true,

120
05:41.400 --> 05:42.400
for so many years,

121
05:42.420 --> 05:44.480
he has been secretly tracking our whereabouts,

122
05:44.480 --> 05:46.140
but we know nothing about him.

123
05:50.710 --> 05:52.560
If it's about immortality,

124
05:53.480 --> 05:54.720
you can ask Yu Tu.

125
05:55.830 --> 05:57.700
After all, she knows the most about it.

126
05:57.700 --> 05:58.159
Okay.

127
05:58.680 --> 05:59.610
I'll go with you.

128
06:03.960 --> 06:05.620
Are you still feeling unwell?

129
06:05.830 --> 06:06.680
I feel dizzy.

130
06:13.230 --> 06:14.520
Why are you so hot?

131
06:15.560 --> 06:17.170
Do you have a fever?

132
06:17.240 --> 06:19.300
Let me take you to the hospital first.

133
06:20.920 --> 06:22.160
Thanks, baby.

134
06:23.040 --> 06:23.890
Don't worry.

135
06:27.500 --> 06:29.020
[Blood Collection Hall]

136
06:29.950 --> 06:30.830
Fill this out, right?

137
06:30.830 --> 06:31.870
Number 51.

138
06:33.159 --> 06:34.830
Number 51.

139
06:36.630 --> 06:38.560
Number 52.

140
06:40.950 --> 06:41.950
Are you scared?

141
06:44.010 --> 06:44.940
Are you kidding?

142
06:45.480 --> 06:46.510
I'm not even afraid of death.

143
06:46.510 --> 06:47.390
Why would I be afraid of this?

144
06:47.390 --> 06:48.190
Really?

145
06:52.120 --> 06:52.980
It's your turn.

146
06:59.590 --> 07:00.590
Clench your fist.

147
07:02.240 --> 07:04.160
Number 53.

148
07:04.630 --> 07:05.160
I'm fine now.

149
07:05.160 --> 07:07.220
Let's go back and help Qiu find clues.

150
07:08.430 --> 07:09.510
No way.

151
07:09.560 --> 07:10.950
I made a promise to Song Yiqiu,

152
07:10.950 --> 07:11.870
and I must keep it.

153
07:11.870 --> 07:13.750
You run an art gallery. You're not a cop.

154
07:13.750 --> 07:15.010
Why do you care so much?

155
07:16.480 --> 07:17.160
I'm sorry.

156
07:17.450 --> 07:19.160
My friend is a little afraid

157
07:19.270 --> 07:20.310
of needles.

158
07:20.310 --> 07:20.970
No, I'm not.

159
07:22.680 --> 07:23.140
Come on.

160
07:26.390 --> 07:26.870
Come on.

161
07:26.870 --> 07:27.800
Go away. Go away.

162
07:30.630 --> 07:32.490
Don't be afraid. Don't be afraid.

163
07:35.490 --> 07:36.170
What?

164
07:36.800 --> 07:38.240
So there really are more immortals

165
07:38.240 --> 07:40.700
in this world than just my uncle and Ms. Song.

166
07:41.120 --> 07:42.240
Of course.

167
07:42.310 --> 07:44.430
Did you think my sister and I were the only two demons?

168
07:44.430 --> 07:45.870
Exactly.

169
07:46.310 --> 07:46.970
Aren't you?

170
07:47.480 --> 07:49.800
The reasons for immortality in this world

171
07:49.800 --> 07:51.390
mostly stem from obsession.

172
07:51.390 --> 07:53.000
Extreme love or hate

173
07:53.310 --> 07:55.310
can make time stop.

174
07:56.120 --> 07:57.750
He killed people in the Republic of China era,

175
07:57.750 --> 07:58.950
and now he's secretly using tricks

176
07:58.950 --> 08:00.240
to surround our house.

177
08:00.240 --> 08:02.240
He doesn't sound like a good person.

178
08:02.310 --> 08:03.430
I don't even want to think

179
08:03.430 --> 08:05.040
about what he'll do next.

180
08:05.280 --> 08:05.800
No.

181
08:06.530 --> 08:07.890
Ning Changyue and I

182
08:07.920 --> 08:09.720
can get hurt and sick now.

183
08:10.120 --> 08:11.000
So,

184
08:12.070 --> 08:14.070
we could die at any time.

185
08:15.160 --> 08:16.390
Before that,

186
08:17.120 --> 08:19.270
I must catch that scumbag.

187
08:34.600 --> 08:35.799
Don't tell Song Yiqiu

188
08:36.470 --> 08:38.000
about what happened today.

189
08:39.720 --> 08:40.360
What?

190
08:45.030 --> 08:46.320
You mean

191
08:47.240 --> 08:48.270
your phobia of needles?

192
08:48.270 --> 08:49.360
I'm not afraid.

193
08:51.000 --> 08:51.930
I won't tell her.

194
08:52.080 --> 08:52.940
Don't tell her.

195
09:04.240 --> 09:04.770
Oh my god.

196
09:06.910 --> 09:07.370
This...

197
09:07.840 --> 09:08.640
What's wrong?

198
09:11.870 --> 09:12.840
Is it serious?

199
09:15.480 --> 09:16.480
Am I going to die?

200
09:23.240 --> 09:23.900
Look at you.

201
09:24.240 --> 09:25.600
No, no, no.

202
09:26.240 --> 09:27.240
I'm just kidding.

203
09:27.600 --> 09:28.550
The doctor said

204
09:28.550 --> 09:29.790
you just have a slight cold.

205
09:29.790 --> 09:31.720
You'll be fine after taking some medicine.

206
09:31.720 --> 09:32.650
Seriously, you.

207
09:34.290 --> 09:35.480
I wonder how Song Yiqiu

208
09:35.480 --> 09:36.390
is doing now.

209
09:39.870 --> 09:40.790
My old lady,

210
09:41.080 --> 09:42.550
be good.

211
09:42.550 --> 09:43.680
When you get better,

212
09:43.680 --> 09:45.610
I'll cook whatever you want to eat.

213
09:46.000 --> 09:47.120
Okay, okay.

214
09:49.390 --> 09:50.190
Are you happy?

215
09:52.630 --> 09:53.750
Be good.

216
09:53.870 --> 09:54.550
Okay.

217
09:55.120 --> 09:55.790
Okay.

218
09:56.960 --> 09:57.720
Lin Huai.

219
10:00.000 --> 10:01.080
If

220
10:02.480 --> 10:04.210
you were going to die tomorrow,

221
10:06.600 --> 10:07.730
would you be afraid?

222
10:10.070 --> 10:12.000
Die tomorrow?

223
10:13.030 --> 10:14.360
Of course I'd be afraid.

224
10:16.790 --> 10:18.320
Have you ever heard

225
10:18.600 --> 10:19.480
that before people die,

226
10:19.480 --> 10:20.960
their whole life

227
10:20.960 --> 10:22.490
flashes before their eyes?

228
10:24.770 --> 10:26.250
What I fear most is

229
10:26.430 --> 10:28.970
waiting until next time to say what I want to say,

230
10:28.970 --> 10:31.700
and waiting until next time to do what I want to do.

231
10:32.020 --> 10:33.410
But if I die tomorrow,

232
10:33.510 --> 10:34.970
there will be no next time.

233
10:36.960 --> 10:38.290
That's what I fear most.

234
10:56.630 --> 10:58.230
I have to go back and help Qiu.

235
10:59.550 --> 11:00.870
These photos and notes

236
11:00.870 --> 11:02.080
are our clues.

237
11:02.390 --> 11:03.390
Find the people from each era

238
11:03.390 --> 11:04.690
who could have contacted them.

239
11:04.690 --> 11:06.980
The mastermind must be among them.

240
11:07.770 --> 11:10.270
From the unofficial records of Southern Qin,

241
11:10.270 --> 11:12.800
to the alumni directory of the Republic of China,

242
11:12.800 --> 11:14.530
not a single one can be missing,

243
11:28.300 --> 11:33.210
♪ You said you were content to linger in the space between ♪

244
11:33.230 --> 11:36.960
♪ Unwilling to cross the line you drew for me yourself ♪

245
11:37.360 --> 11:39.160
♪ But in the end ♪

246
11:39.660 --> 11:42.520
♪ One foot of yours still steps across the line ♪

247
11:42.550 --> 11:47.390
♪ While the other remains on the other side ♪

248
11:48.100 --> 11:51.390
♪ Keeping me shut out ♪

249
11:51.800 --> 11:54.140
♪ And now all that's left is me ♪

250
11:54.160 --> 11:57.040
♪ With nothing but this dizziness as the ending ♪

251
11:57.060 --> 12:03.140
♪ And I ♪

252
12:03.530 --> 12:07.890
♪ I thought I could hold on for another day ♪

253
12:09.710 --> 12:12.550
♪ Hoping to find the part of you that still wants to save me ♪

254
12:12.570 --> 12:21.920
♪ I once thought I was strong enough to endure ♪

255
12:24.140 --> 12:27.790
♪ I should have known all along that you would be the one to break me ♪

256
12:34.910 --> 12:35.790
I got it.

257
12:37.360 --> 12:38.240
Come here, quick.

258
12:38.240 --> 12:38.840
Coming.

259
12:39.030 --> 12:40.230
What did you find out?

260
12:41.120 --> 12:42.980
You two write this sentence down.

261
12:54.630 --> 12:55.760
This is what I wrote.

262
12:56.390 --> 12:57.920
Can you see the difference?

263
12:59.730 --> 13:01.150
[They have been in love for 3,000 years]

264
13:00.000 --> 13:00.910
Mine is uglier?

265
13:01.600 --> 13:03.000
There's one extra stroke

266
13:03.630 --> 13:05.160
in "love" compared to mine.

267
13:06.120 --> 13:07.670
But I wrote it the same way.

268
13:11.750 --> 13:12.790
Wh-wh-wh-

269
13:12.790 --> 13:13.840
What does it mean?

270
13:14.030 --> 13:16.930
This is a unique writing style of the Southern Qin royal family.

271
13:16.930 --> 13:17.680
Legend has it

272
13:18.000 --> 13:20.080
that the mother of the late Emperor of Southern Qin

273
13:20.080 --> 13:21.850
had the character "love" in her given name.

274
13:21.850 --> 13:22.910
According to tradition,

275
13:22.910 --> 13:25.010
one stroke should be omitted when writing it

276
13:25.010 --> 13:26.360
to observe the naming taboo.

277
13:26.360 --> 13:27.950
But the late Emperor believed

278
13:27.950 --> 13:30.320
that omitting a stroke would lose its original meaning.

279
13:30.320 --> 13:31.440
So he decreed

280
13:31.590 --> 13:33.570
that all royal children and palace officials,

281
13:33.570 --> 13:35.050
when writing the character. "love",

282
13:35.050 --> 13:36.380
must add an extra stroke

283
13:36.670 --> 13:38.070
to manifest its meaning.

284
13:39.200 --> 13:40.350
What does

285
13:43.200 --> 13:44.030
this mean?

286
13:46.720 --> 13:49.720
The person who's been working against us all this time

287
13:50.030 --> 13:52.160
is from the Southern Qin royal family.

288
14:05.040 --> 14:05.900
How is it going?

289
14:05.900 --> 14:06.780
Any progress?

290
14:08.130 --> 14:09.730
Do you want something to eat?

291
14:23.120 --> 14:24.200
This is...

292
14:26.030 --> 14:26.750
The scope is now

293
14:26.750 --> 14:28.440
narrowed down to the Southern Qin royal family.

294
14:28.440 --> 14:29.600
But the Southern Qin royal family

295
14:29.600 --> 14:31.060
has thousands of members.

296
14:31.120 --> 14:33.070
So we have to check them one by one,

297
14:33.090 --> 14:34.170
look into their backgrounds,

298
14:34.170 --> 14:35.830
and rule them out one at a time.

299
14:46.850 --> 14:48.180
These jade pendants...

300
14:49.150 --> 14:50.750
Why do they look so familiar?

301
14:54.600 --> 14:56.080
I think I saw one on the person

302
14:56.080 --> 14:57.410
who killed me back then.

303
14:57.860 --> 14:59.860
But the pattern was a bit different.

304
15:02.390 --> 15:03.790
Draw it.

305
15:05.540 --> 15:06.030
Okay.

306
15:29.270 --> 15:30.400
It looked like this.

307
15:35.600 --> 15:36.910
A snake shape.

308
15:47.360 --> 15:49.080
I've seen this token before.

309
15:52.590 --> 15:53.710
The snake pattern

310
15:54.030 --> 15:55.630
is used by the Chief Eunuch.

311
15:56.670 --> 15:57.720
Could it be him?

312
15:59.480 --> 16:01.880
We've been looking in the wrong direction.

313
16:01.910 --> 16:02.870
In the palace,

314
16:03.240 --> 16:05.670
the people subject to the taboo weren't just members of the imperial family,

315
16:05.670 --> 16:07.330
but also the palace servants.

316
16:07.480 --> 16:09.960
The one who could access the core secret of immortality

317
16:09.960 --> 16:11.490
and become obsessed with it

318
16:12.080 --> 16:14.290
is the Emperor's chief eunuch,

319
16:15.150 --> 16:15.960
Liu Yi.

320
16:18.730 --> 16:21.330
He was the one who caught Yu Tu to take his blood.

321
16:23.130 --> 16:25.060
He was also the one who injured you.

322
16:25.870 --> 16:27.200
Your Highness.

323
16:27.710 --> 16:31.160
You know what to do now, right?

324
16:32.190 --> 16:33.760
He was the one who locked me in Duansi Palace,

325
16:33.760 --> 16:35.600
and forced me to marry.

326
16:36.710 --> 16:37.670
Impossible.

327
16:39.240 --> 16:41.100
He couldn't have lived until now.

328
16:42.000 --> 16:43.240
Unless

329
16:44.570 --> 16:46.450
he used some dark magic.

330
16:49.480 --> 16:50.320
No wonder.

331
16:50.910 --> 16:52.270
He knows we can't die,

332
16:52.490 --> 16:54.310
and ordinary assassinations are meaningless.

333
16:54.310 --> 16:56.370
So he presumptuously killed Lin Huai

334
16:56.570 --> 16:58.660
to find ways to torture you.

335
17:02.050 --> 17:03.440
I see.

336
17:04.440 --> 17:05.569
He is in the shadows,

337
17:06.200 --> 17:07.599
and we are out in the open.

338
17:11.440 --> 17:12.920
It's been 3,000 years.

339
17:17.440 --> 17:20.069
It's time to settle our grudge.

340
17:32.340 --> 17:33.980
[Survivor of General Yu's Rebellion, Southern Qin]

341
17:36.830 --> 17:37.640
Here are all the men

342
17:37.640 --> 17:39.350
who've shown up around the areas you and Ms. Song frequent

343
17:39.350 --> 17:40.270
over the past six months

344
17:40.270 --> 17:42.230
and look somewhat like

345
17:42.310 --> 17:43.970
the photo she reconstructed.

346
17:59.590 --> 18:00.650
Manager Qing Yuan.

347
18:02.790 --> 18:03.550
Mr. Ning,

348
18:04.110 --> 18:05.310
what brings you here?

349
18:05.540 --> 18:07.640
Why didn't you have your assistant notify me in advance

350
18:07.640 --> 18:09.370
so I could greet you at the door?

351
18:10.160 --> 18:13.640
Are you looking for a new direction for your collection today?

352
18:13.960 --> 18:15.350
Not exactly a direction.

353
18:15.350 --> 18:16.310
Your auction house

354
18:16.310 --> 18:17.750
handles a lot of items, right?

355
18:17.750 --> 18:19.020
I'd like you to help me check

356
18:19.020 --> 18:21.880
if you've ever seen an identity token of this style.

357
18:26.590 --> 18:28.020
This identity token

358
18:28.390 --> 18:30.660
has strong Southern Qin characteristics.

359
18:30.660 --> 18:32.920
This is indeed an item from Southern Qin.

360
18:33.050 --> 18:34.850
The owner of this identity token

361
18:37.000 --> 18:37.930
is my old friend.

362
18:38.700 --> 18:39.500
Finding it

363
18:39.520 --> 18:41.090
might lead to news about him.

364
18:41.090 --> 18:42.720
So I hope you can keep an eye out.

365
18:42.720 --> 18:45.000
Whether on the market or through private channels,

366
18:45.000 --> 18:46.870
if you see anything with a similar pattern,

367
18:46.870 --> 18:48.270
please notify me immediately.

368
18:48.270 --> 18:49.180
I have a friend

369
18:49.400 --> 18:52.310
who happens to be an expert in Southern Qin artifacts.

370
18:52.310 --> 18:53.000
How about

371
18:53.270 --> 18:54.550
I contact them for you?

372
18:54.550 --> 18:55.350
That's great.

373
18:55.510 --> 18:56.550
Please contact them for me right away.

374
18:56.550 --> 18:57.510
I'll head over right now.

375
18:57.510 --> 18:58.160
Okay.

376
19:02.420 --> 19:04.350
I was recommended by Manager Qing Yuan.

377
19:04.350 --> 19:04.830
Okay.

378
19:18.240 --> 19:20.550
This is a unique writing style of the Southern Qin royal family.

379
19:20.550 --> 19:22.680
that all royal children and palace officials,

380
19:22.680 --> 19:24.160
when writing the character. "love",

381
19:24.160 --> 19:25.490
must add an extra stroke

382
19:25.830 --> 19:27.290
to emphasize its meaning.

383
19:29.300 --> 19:30.150
Qing Yuan.

384
19:32.790 --> 19:33.720
Where is Qing Yuan?

385
19:33.720 --> 19:34.520
She just left.

386
19:34.540 --> 19:36.190
Today is her last day at work.

387
19:37.550 --> 19:38.510
[Longevity and Love Lidded Jar, Southern Qin]

388
20:05.750 --> 20:07.160
Manager Qing Yuan.

389
20:07.830 --> 20:09.240
I brought you some fruit.

390
20:09.880 --> 20:10.810
Long time no see,

391
20:13.880 --> 20:14.950
Princess Ningjia.
